    "name": "Single-time Gaussian proximal ATE",
    "title_en": null,
    "family_id": "cui-pu-shi-miao-tchetgen-2024-gaussian-proximal",
    "generation_equations": [
      "设 `X=(X1,X2)`，`σ(t)=1/(1+exp(-t))`。对每个个体依次生成：",
      "1. `X ~ Normal_2((0.25,0.25), [[0.0625,0],[0,0.0625]])`。",
      "2. `A | X ~ Bernoulli(σ(-0.125 X1 - 0.125 X2))`。",
      "3. `V=(Z,W,U)^T | A,X ~ Normal_3(μ(A,X),Σ)`，其中",
      "`μ(A,X) = (0.25,0.25,0.25)^T + A(0.25,0.125,0.25)^T + (0.25 X1 + 0.25 X2)(1,1,1)^T`；",
      "`Σ = [[1,0.25,0.5],[0.25,1,0.5],[0.5,0.5,1]]`；行列顺序为 `(Z,W,U)`。",
      "4. 定义 `g(U,X) = 0.25 + 0.25(X1+X2) + 0.5[U - 0.25 - 0.25(X1+X2)]`，取 `εY ~ Normal(0,0.25²)` 且独立于前述高斯抽样误差，令",
      "`Y = 2 + 2A + 0.25(X1+X2) + (4-2)g(U,X) + 2W + εY`。",
      "等价的结果公式为 `Y = 2.25 + 2A + 0.5(X1+X2) + U + 2W + εY`。以上条件分布及系数对应 `config.json` 的 `original` 场景。抽样单位为独立个体，个体内 `(Z,W,U)` 按给定条件协方差联合生成。"
    ],
